Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] FreeChat: remove disappearing messages locally from
 server markers

The server purges expired messages without a redaction. The timeline now
hides messages whose unsigned.com.freechat.expires_at passed (checked every
second, offline too) and, every 30 seconds, asks the server which marked
messages still exist (existing_events) to drop burned ones.
